# What a container build is allowed to see. Everything below is either rebuilt
# inside the image or must never be baked into a layer. Note that .gitignore
# has no say here: a deploy uploads the working directory as it is on disk,
# and a stale .next alone is several hundred megabytes of nothing.

# Rebuilt inside the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Never in a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.husky

# Not part of any service.
apps/e2e
**/*.log
